Phase 6 구현·1-seed debug: conditional approval — after MF-1~MF-3 implemented and passing (MF-4~MF-5 concurrently)
3-seed run: separate gate — after 1-seed debug artifact review
금지 범위: B0-B/B1/B2/Stage C execution, test 163, P1, T5Gemma2 (D-108 STOP), post-hoc
  threshold/seed/donor/step changes, cross-arm absolute CE comparisons, label generalization
최대 compute: prereg §8 as-is — 9 trained units × 100 updates + M eval-only, ≤2 CPU-hours, 6 threads, no GPU, no auto-retry
다음 decision gate: 1-seed debug artifacts → 3-seed gate → new decision record for B0-B
